  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FNI: Supporting Armenia&#x2019;s CBD CoP presidency and domestic implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve governance of biodiversity in Armenia with a high inclusion of civil society in environmental decision-making by: (1) preparing for and supporting the Armenian government&#x2019;s CoP presidency, (2) support Armenia&#x2019;s domestic implementation of its National Biodiversity Strategy and Action Plan (NBSAP) and; (3) increase the involvement of Armenian civil society in domestic protection of biodiversity as well as its participation at CBD CoP-17. There will be a specific focus on increasing gender mainstreaming in Armenias NBSAP, and the criteria for Gender-marker significant is followed.</narrative>
  </description>
